# Renderer > Render Method > Case Textures in a shipped map: the same view as the game draws it and with the colour
# maps replaced by the grids of their sizes, with the legend.
map_open mp_rust
wait 25
act camera.next_spawn
wait 2
r_mode game
wait 1
ed_shot $OUT\case_0_game.png
wait 1
r_mode case
wait 2
ed_shot $OUT\case_1_case.png
wait 1
r_status
expect [renderer] case
r_mode game
quit
